"""28 October 2026 : ZenRay Meshes COMPONENT SHEET (task KS3). The six traced views (ViewTrace) regrouped by component : one board per
component, one cell per view where it has lines, each cell cropped around that component's lines so that its curves read at a glance (its
lines thick in its colour with their control points, the other lines of the view thin grey for context, the clay view faded behind).
A component with no traced line in any view gets an empty board that says so : that is the list of curves still to draw (KS3).
Writes versions/components/Comp_<component>.png, the assembled versions/Schematic_components.png, and work/car/schematic/components.json,
the index mapping component -> (view, line index, kind, control point count) that a network builder reads.
python ComponentSheet.py [--components hood,roof,...]
FR : la planche par composant : chaque composant dessiné seul dans chaque vue où il a des traits, pour une validation un par un."""
